{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24032","headline":"首夏 · 白居易","name":"首夏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"林静蚊未生，池静蛙未鸣。\n景长天气好，竟日和且清。\n春禽余哢在，夏木新阴成。\n兀尔水边坐，翛然桥上行。\n自问一何适，身闲官不轻。\n料钱随月用，生计逐日营。\n食饱慙伯夷，酒足媿渊明。\n寿倍颜氏子，富百黔娄生。\n有一即爲乐，况吾四者幷。\n所以私自慰，虽老有心情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24032.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24032","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}